  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n21 - [29 - {27 - (43 - 15 ÷ 3 × 4 of 3 + 2)}]\n\n⇒ 21 – [29 – {27 – (43 – 15 ÷ 3 × 12 + 2)}]\n\n⇒ 21 – [29 – {27 – (43 – 5 × 12 + 2)}]\n\n⇒ 21 – [29 – {27 – (43 – 60 + 2)}]\n\n⇒ 21 – [29 – {27 – (45 - 60)}]\n\n⇒ 21 – [29 – {27 – (-15)}]\n\n⇒ 21 – [29 – {27 + 15}]\n\n⇒ 21 – [29 – 42]\n\n⇒ 21 – (-13)\n\n⇒ 21 + 13\n\n⇒ 34\n\n**∴ The required value is 34**",
